# Keep the Docker build context small. Each Dockerfile copies only what it needs.

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/drizzle
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/web/next-env.d.ts

# Git, editors, OS files
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
.claude
.superpowers
.vscode
.idea
_tmp_*

# Secrets — keys never go into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Not needed to run the app
docs
art
**/test
**/coverage
**/vitest.config.ts
README.md
docker-compose.yaml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# Keep: apps/web/public (3D models, world.json) — it is NOT ignored.
